<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day T-bill steady at 8.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day T-bill steady at 8.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of nndia (RBI) said it set a cut-off price of 98.00 rupees at its weekly five billion rupee auction of 91-day treasury bills held on Friday..</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged from the previous week's 8.19 percent.</p>
